  "solution_ref": "(i) $b=1,2$: $-3<k<5$ 전부 만족 → 불가. (ii) $b\\ge3$, 극솟값 $m=f\\left(1+\\frac b2\\right)$: $m>-3$, $m<-3$은 불가, $m=-3$일 때 $k=-3$만 만족. $a\\left(\\frac b2-1\\right)\\left(1-\\frac b2\\right)+9=-3$ → $a(b-2)^2=48$ → $(a,b)=(48,3),(12,4),(3,6)$. 최댓값 $51$",
